# The oldest Node the box helper supports, for the helper's cases to run on beside the machine's own node: the newest
# release of Node internal/browser/boxhelper.MinNodeMajor, an official release named by its version and, for each of
# the four platforms the engine is released for, the SHA-256 of that platform's tarball
# (nodejs.org/dist/v<version>/node-v<version>-<platform>.tar.xz). scripts/node.sh fetches it — the one recipe CI and a
# contributor's `make node` share — and nothing else in the tree spells its version: the Makefile asks
# scripts/node.sh, and ci.yml keys its cache on the pins below and the recipe's layout, never on this file's comments.
# The engine image carries no Node, and no release changes with this file. It is the one Node version the tree names,
# because a check moves it (CONTRIBUTING.md, "Which node").
#
# No Dependabot ecosystem watches a Node release, so .github/workflows/pins.yml does: every week its floor Node leg runs
# scripts/node-pin-check.sh, which reads nodejs.org's release index for the newest release of the floor's major and,
# for a pin that is behind, verifies that release's SHASUMS256.txt against the Node.js releasers' keys
# (scripts/node-release-keys.asc, held to the fingerprints the check pins), downloads each platform's tarball and
# requires its SHA-256 to be the one the signed list names, and prints the pin's new lines — which the workflow keeps
# in one issue, `node pin behind upstream`. It fails from 60 days before the floor's major reaches its end of life
# (nodejs/Release's schedule.json) too, naming the next even major's newest release the same way, and its `key` step
# from 60 days before any releaser's key stops signing. A bump replaces the pin's lines from that report (or the
# script run by hand); then `make node` and `make check`, in a pull request titled `build(deps): bump node's floor from
# <a> to <b>`. Raising the floor is a change to boxhelper.MinNodeMajor that moves this pin with it, in a pull request
# titled `build(deps): raise node's floor from <a> to <b>`, each a major.
NODE_FLOOR_VERSION=22.23.5
NODE_FLOOR_SHA256_LINUX_X64=cdeb8670a0c81f51b4dc4ac61919f9b1ad917b304bf8221eb939570663d240f8
NODE_FLOOR_SHA256_LINUX_ARM64=2babb9eb5264860d540849f4b064a6fbdebcdc323657d9d382ce23d313fd5e09
NODE_FLOOR_SHA256_DARWIN_X64=d68bf234a07781141dfca61ae4461c24560f70bd53223d76a41529eb02e8554e
NODE_FLOOR_SHA256_DARWIN_ARM64=d0c68c321161bb2c6483efea9a343010dea8e5e7f60d73c6a7eba140016d662f
